PROJ
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The map projections, ellipsoid helpers and datum grid interpolation in crates/terrio-crs/src/
are ported from PROJ (https://proj.org).
The Mollweide and Wagner IV/V formulas follow src/projections/moll.cpp at PROJ commit
5fa31c29f0a806568ed7bc76c1a557604db4a804.
The near-sided and tilted perspective formulas follow src/projections/nsper.cpp in PROJ 9.8.1.
The interrupted Goode homolosine follows src/projections/igh.cpp in PROJ 9.8.1.
The general oblique transformation follows src/projections/ob_tran.cpp in PROJ 9.8.1.
The quadrilateralized spherical cube follows src/projections/qsc.cpp in PROJ 9.8.1.
